WEBVTT

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:03.040
Browse containers on the Studio server.

00:00:03.040 --> 00:00:05.320
Open report-worker to inspect the stopped container.

00:00:05.320 --> 00:00:09.490
Review the target and confirm Start.

00:00:09.490 --> 00:00:12.910
Read the latest log entries from the worker.

00:00:12.910 --> 00:00:18.300
Select site-content to inspect its mount point.

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:20.960
Check the published and exposed container ports.
